opf-rs — Rust runtime for the screenpipe-pii-redactor / OPF v3 model
Copyright 2026 Mediar, Inc.

This crate is a pure-Rust inference runtime for the
[`screenpipe/pii-redactor`](https://huggingface.co/screenpipe/pii-redactor)
model, a fine-tuned derivative of OpenAI's Privacy Filter
([github.com/openai/privacy-filter](https://github.com/openai/privacy-filter),
Apache 2.0).

This crate does NOT redistribute the fine-tuned model weights or the
upstream Apache 2.0 base weights — users obtain those at runtime from
HuggingFace under their respective licenses. The Apache 2.0 license
text is included in `LICENSE.upstream-apache2.txt` solely as a
courtesy reference for users who download the upstream weights through
this crate's loader.

Architectural concepts (rotary embeddings, mixture-of-experts feed-
forward, attention sinks, RMSNorm, sliding-window mask) were
re-implemented in candle following the upstream Apache 2.0 reference
implementation in `opf._model.model`. Re-implementation, not
redistribution — every line of code in this crate is original.

